  (descr "Mechanical LED mask. Origin: centre, PCB top Z=0. Silkscreen: exact base contact edges and 8 LED chambers at 3 mm pitch. Mounting: two 2.8 mm NPTH clearance holes for M2.5 screws, centres X=+/-14.487689 mm, Y=0. Courtyard: complete assembly outline plus 0.25 mm, with eight LED chamber cutouts matching the base contact edges. Back keepouts: two 3.5 mm radius areas split around the mounting drills, washer/nut envelope plus 0.5 mm; no tracks, vias, pads, copper pours or back footprints. Source: BarraLED_Maschera.step.")
